Package: echarts4rTreePoc
Title: Prostate Cancer Treatment Pathway Explorer
Version: 0.1.0
Description: Shiny application visualising prostate cancer treatment pathways
    as an interactive echarts4r tree, with a linked surveillance PSA panel.
    Runs on a synthetic cohort; no real patient data is used or required.
    Scoping prototype, not a validated clinical tool.
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    shiny (>= 1.7.0),
    dplyr (>= 1.1.0),
    tidyr (>= 1.2.0),
    purrr (>= 1.0.0),
    tibble (>= 3.0.0),
    ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0),
    echarts4r (>= 0.4.5),
    htmlwidgets (>= 1.5.4),
    visNetwork (>= 2.1.0),
    igraph (>= 1.3.0)
Suggests:
    pak,
    renv
